1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:06,040
Rosa: Marcus. Hands at ten and two.
Breathe. And don't stop for anything.

2
00:00:06,360 --> 00:00:11,147
BUS-E: Ding dong! This is the Last Bus.
Part ten of ten: Pier 8.

3
00:00:11,467 --> 00:00:12,620
Marcus: Which pedal is the brake?

4
00:00:12,740 --> 00:00:13,674
Rosa: The big one.

5
00:00:13,794 --> 00:00:14,774
Marcus: They're both big!

6
00:00:15,094 --> 00:00:17,012
Priya: The ferry leaves in twelve minutes.

7
00:00:17,332 --> 00:00:20,222
Coach Dex: Over here! Three whistle
blasts, that's us!

8
00:00:20,342 --> 00:00:22,220
Maya: Dad, are those the survivors?

9
00:00:22,340 --> 00:00:24,040
Coach Dex: Maya, not now!

10
00:00:24,360 --> 00:00:27,346
Rosa: Horn. Aim it at the end of the pier.

11
00:00:27,466 --> 00:00:28,749
Marcus: You can aim a horn?

12
00:00:28,869 --> 00:00:30,488
Rosa: Everything can be aimed.

13
00:00:34,008 --> 00:00:34,965
Dante: He is heavy!

14
00:00:35,085 --> 00:00:37,224
Walt: Mmm. Five more minutes.

15
00:00:37,544 --> 00:00:38,944
Priya: Rosa, come with us.

16
00:00:39,064 --> 00:00:41,548
Rosa: Ten hours. I said I would get you
here.

17
00:00:41,868 --> 00:00:42,379
Teddy: Come with us!

18
00:00:42,499 --> 00:00:44,663
Rosa: Somebody has to turn off the lights.

19
00:00:44,983 --> 00:00:46,171
Steve: I have a ticket.

20
00:00:46,291 --> 00:00:47,285
Rosa: ...Welcome aboard.

21
00:00:47,405 --> 00:00:49,090
BUS-E: Thank you for riding the Last Bus.

22
00:00:49,410 --> 00:00:50,555
Walt: Did I miss something?

23
00:00:51,010 --> 00:00:55,255
BUS-E: Part ten of ten, the end of The
Last Bus. Follow for the next series.

